{
  "case": "due2-concept-purpose",
  "source": "due2-native (pins decisions/0015 #3-#5 and #7: a purpose permission over a SKOS concept scheme; issues #52, #69)",
  "classification": "odrl-core",
  "needs": [],
  "notes": "Authored for due2; no origin result. The scheme is DPV 2.1's purposes, abridged to four concepts and kept in policy.ttl. odrl:purpose is bound in the baseline, and the policy adds its scheme with due2:conceptScheme, which adds up across layers (decisions/0015 #6). Scenarios 5 and 6 take ex:EmailMarketing's edges from the SOTW, as a deployment's own purposes would arrive.",
